sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title HackMatch — US-016: Recommended Teams for Participants — Sequence Diagram
    actor PART as Verified PART
    participant UI as RecommendedTeamsPage
    participant API as Express API + scoringAuthGuard
    participant SVC as recommendedTeams service
    participant REPO as teams / profile repositories
    participant SCORE as compatibilityScoring (US-015)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / Supabase

    PART->>UI: Open "Recommended" from the primary nav
    UI->>API: GET /api/scoring/teams/recommendations
    Note over UI,API: No userId, teamId or eventId parameter is sent
    API->>API: requireFirebaseAuth, requireMfa,<br/>requireActiveAccount, requireParticipantRole,<br/>requireVerifiedParticipant
    API->>SVC: getRecommendedTeamsForParticipant(req.participant.id)

    SVC->>REPO: findById,<br/>findProfileByParticipantId,<br/>findSkillsByParticipantId,<br/>findByParticipantId
    REPO->>DB: Read the actor profile, skills and platform availability
    DB-->>REPO: primaryRole, skills, commitmentHours, goal

    SVC->>REPO: findOpenTeamRecords({ withMemberIdentities: false })
    REPO->>DB: Open teams with Open vacancies and Confirmed members
    DB-->>REPO: OpenTeamRecord[]
    SVC->>SVC: filterOpenTeams(records, unset query, now)<br/>moderation, lifecycle and open-slot eligibility

    SVC->>REPO: findConfirmedTeamIdsForParticipant(actorId)
    REPO-->>SVC: Team ids to exclude
    SVC->>SVC: Drop the actor's own teams and joined teams

    alt At least one eligible (team, vacancy) pair
        SVC->>SCORE: computeCompatibilityScore(slot, candidate)
        SCORE-->>SVC: score, displayScore, matchedSkills,<br/>roleMatched, components
        SVC->>SVC: sortWithCompatibilityRanks<br/>score, then team name, then teamId:vacancyId
        SVC->>SVC: buildPublicScoreExplanation,<br/>assertPublicExplanationSafe,<br/>omitInternalIdentifierFields
        SVC->>SVC: Keep the top 10 ranked teams<br/>(RECOMMENDED_TEAMS_CAP)
        SVC-->>API: status ok, ranked teams, notice
    else Scoring unavailable (NR-016)
        SVC-->>API: status degraded, unranked teams,<br/>degradedNotice, no rank or score
    else No eligible team
        SVC-->>API: status ok, empty true,<br/>user-visible message, notice
    end

    API->>API: Cache-Control: no-store
    API-->>UI: 200 RecommendedTeamsResponse
    UI-->>PART: Match percentage, matched skill tags,<br/>role match, Apply per card
    PART->>UI: Apply to a recommended team
    UI->>UI: onApply({ teamId, vacancyId, role, teamName })
    UI-->>PART: Existing US-018 ApplicationFormPanel opens
